    "lesson": "The intent anchor pointed at plano-testes-unitarios.md, but Scout resolved unit-tests.yml, .gitignore, AGENTS.md, path-cases.txt and makefile for a referential task — a likely wrong target. Avoid: confirm the intended target before proceeding when Scout's resolved files diverge from the anchor named in the task.",
