    "lesson": "The reviewer blocked the task repeatedly (category code-quality, 3x): max_lines_per_file threshold violated — MidiExporter.cpp is 216 lines (`wc -l` confirms), 16 over the configured 200-line cap, while the actor's result claimed compliance. Avoid: re-check the code-quality guardrails (line caps included) before declaring a task done; when a file is near the cap, split it first (see ADR-0034).",
